opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "Client for the CoworkingView public API"
description: """
Read-only OCaml client for the public CoworkingView API
(https://api.coworkingview.com). It covers paginated catalogue search
(GET /v1/properties) and the CoworkingView Price Index
(GET /v1/market/rates). No API key.

Price Index figures are CC BY 4.0. Every rates result includes the
attribution string returned by the API. Catalogue results omit operator
photos, logos and descriptions, and a search that follows pages stops
at 200 listings.
"""
maintainer: ["CoworkingView <info@coworkingview.com>"]
